    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a really strong angle. I think our audience will respond well to that. Can you expand on that bit about 'clarity'? Like, maybe write a short paragraph explaining why the lack of a traditional structure can actually be confusing or even harmful for a kid's sense of identity?",
